33	2021-09-23 13:41:29.203	1969-12-31 18:00:00	t	2021-09-23 13:41:29.203		pluginList	List of Installed Plugins	siteAdmin	pluginList:\n    kind: panel\n    name: pluginList\n    label: List of Installed Plugins\n    footer: false\n    contents:\n        ${pluginTable}\n        ${pluginTableScript}\n\n\n
